        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-24T01:33:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would only need to be added as an argument to two functions: `Process(Block*, etc.)` and `PutInLet`, as far as I can tell. I\u0027m not a fan of \"global\" state cache that needs careful invalidation.",
      "parentUuid": "451a06b3_64d38960",
      "revId": "df5abc9ebc4fc077c94065292ab5874fa49b3b49",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "16428dfd_c6f01167",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/hlsl/writer/raise/promote_initializers.cc",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
