        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-24T01:37:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Except that ends up being more costly as the hashmap gets destroyed and re-created each time. So you pay the cost of reallocating the hashmap. The `Clear` will maintain the capacity over each block, saving the reallocations.",
      "parentUuid": "b6613cff_b15c3eea",
      "revId": "df5abc9ebc4fc077c94065292ab5874fa49b3b49",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bb2f748e_0f570a58",
